Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.89,0:21:47.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个俄亥俄州的孕妇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:48.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and she picked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:48.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}选了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:51.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:52.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:52.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太为你们高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:01.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This Thanksgiving kicks last Thanksgiving's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:01.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今年的感恩节比去年好太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To Monica and Chandler
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}敬莫妮卡和钱德勒
