Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:12.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有那俄亥俄州的不小心怀孕的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:19.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:19.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们两个终于要有孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you guys are finally getting a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真让我高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:24.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. Have you considered pageanting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:24.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们没考虑过去游行
