Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:30.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就会有孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know how you feel.
